==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Stub|BotW}}
Travel Gates appear outside every [[Ancient Shrine]] and on the top of every [[Sheikah Tower]] and can be used for Warping via the [[Sheikah Slate]]. Travel Gates also appear outside the [[Hateno Ancient Tech Lab]] and the [[Akkala Ancient Tech Lab]]. The [[Travel Medallion]] is a magical [[Object]] that functions like a portable Travel Gate.

==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Stub|TotK}}
Travel Gates appear outside of [[Skyview Tower]]s, [[Temple]]s, and [[Shrine of Light|Shrines of Light]].

